<title>USA: Hollywood Entertainment Q3 sales rise.</title>
<headline>Hollywood Entertainment Q3 sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hollywood Entertainment Corp said Monday same-store sales rose six percent for the quarter ended September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>Details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>The company reiterated in a statement that it is increasing its planned new store openings to 250 from 210 in 1996 and to 300 from 200 in 1997.</p>
<p>Shares of the video store chain were 3/4 higher at 21-1/4 in morning trading on Nasdaq.</p>
